{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-03266-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["중증 환자도 6일 하루 1일 최다인 962명이 발생해 모두 4821명이","사망자가 636명으로 뛰었다"],"reason":"The death toll, confirmed cases, and Wuhan's 10,000+ cases are correct. It garbles the severe cases: it says 962 rose to 4,821 and attaches 'daily record' to 4,821, which mixes up the daily new cases with the cumulative total. It also omits the 73 daily deaths."},"B":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":1,"evidence":["우한 ... 28개의 지정 병원에 모두 8254개의 병상을 갖추고 있으며 8182명이 입원","6일 하루 ... 73명이 숨졌다"],"reason":"The summary is repetitive and garbled. It says Wuhan has 10,000 patients and 8,254 beds, which is wrong, and it merges the facts about beds and admitted patients. The death sentence is circular, and the figure of 636 deaths is confused with 73. It omits severe cases."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["사망자가 636명으로 뛰었다","우한 전투 상황이 아직 고전을 면치 못하고 있다"],"reason":"The summary says the 636 deaths 'had 73 removed', which is unsupported and misstates the relationship. It also links Wuhan's hard-fought situation to the 10,000 cases with a garbled causal relation. The 73 deaths, 30,000 confirmed cases, and severe-case figures are right."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["확진 환자는 6일 자정 처음으로 3만 명을 돌파해 3만 1161명","사망자가 636명"],"reason":"The summary gives the 31,161 confirmed cases as the death toll, which is a clear mix-up. It also omits the 636 total deaths. The severe cases, Wang Chen's remark, and Wuhan's hospital beds are accurate."}}}
